rocknix-splash --animate [backlight]: dots under the logo with a light running along them,
until SIGTERM or two minutes; the given backlight (a panel the framebuffer is mirrored to)
is off meanwhile. Logo and dots are centred as one group and sized for the panel rotation.
Asgard runs it from early boot until sway starts.

